B.aCO=new A.a0("Court Mode, tutorials, puzzle positions, spectators and pass-and-play do not earn match wins. Online seats must belong to different players. Online wins require a human opponent.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.aDH=new A.a0("AI tiers require standard two-player Square games won by road or flats. Stronger AI wins also advance lower tiers. Board craft needs Medium+ AI or independent online opponents; every AI opponent must meet the requirement.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.aCu=new A.a0("Early resignations and timeouts do not count. Online endings count toward general wins only after four full turn cycles; they never earn AI or board-craft awards. Winning a timed game by road or flats counts for Under Pressure.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
